            </svg>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="review-text">
            "Ordered 20 S19 Pros for our facility. All units tested and hashing within spec. Fast shipping and great support from the team."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="review-author">
            <div class="review-author-name">Mike Chen</div>
            <div class="review-author-role">Mining Facility Operator</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review-verified-badge">Verified Purchase</div>
        </div>

        <div class="review-card glass">
