            </svg>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="review-text">
            "Best surplus ASIC source I've found. Hardware arrives as described, tested, and ready to deploy. The Vnish firmware option saved us hours of setup."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="review-author">
            <div class="review-author-name">Sarah Johnson</div>
            <div class="review-author-role">Bitcoin Miner</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review-verified-badge">Verified Purchase</div>
